# The space above the code of an ordinary Structure is its parent (the author's decision 2026-11-11 through fable2, plan
# M11 5b part 2): Bump launched over itself reads the root's hits by the bare name and writes the root's field through
# node -- seen is 5.
int: hits 4
Bump: (node\hits := hits + 1)
call: Bump
int: seen hits
